## The trust dial in the Privacy Receipt panel. It has three steps for the
## site in front. It is not a score.

nirva-trust-label = Trust dial
nirva-trust-dial =
    .aria-label = Trust dial for this site
nirva-trust-step-strict = Strict
nirva-trust-step-balanced = Balanced
nirva-trust-step-trusted = Trusted
nirva-trust-note-strict = Strict: this site’s cookies are erased when you close the browser, media does not start by itself, and the site cannot use your location, camera, microphone or notifications. Some sites will sign you out or lose features.
nirva-trust-note-balanced = Balanced: the browser’s normal protection, with any permissions you have set yourself below.
nirva-trust-note-trusted = Trusted: tracking protection is switched off for this site, so trackers on it are no longer blocked. Use this only for a site you rely on that does not work otherwise.
nirva-trust-toggle = Permissions for this site
